      "date": "2026-02-16T12:13:36.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹3.30 (vs ₹2.28 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹3.30 (up from ₹2.28 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.29b (up 195% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹137.0m (up 51% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (down from 21% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 81% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 165% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
